(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-17","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["沈砚拿正常米价去[[quote|报价]]，车夫却只盯着水盆中的[[bubble|气泡]]。他以前替河边[[plantation|种植园]]运货，知道那股难闻的胶不是[[poison|毒药]]，只是封货胶遇热松开。罗清提出[[objection|异议]]：用途不能替代检验。他们换了[[perspective|角度]]，先追那批胶。车夫[[hesitate|犹豫]]许久，伸出伤痕累累的[[wrist|手腕]]，说送税契的[[merchant|商人]]让他[[mount|登上]]船卸箱，曾用一截[[cigar|雪茄]]点火烘封。他记住烟味，因为火烧疼了手。","床边的[[ash|灰]]让这段[[dispute|争议]]有了实物：车夫用烧剩的包装垫过药瓶。他带着工钱[[appeal|申诉]]到商行，伙计几乎[[explode|发怒]]。许庭说合伙人为村民免税的[[myth|神话]]是他的好意，别来毁名声。沈砚问究竟免的是谁的[[property|财产]]税。账房不答，指挥人去[[drain|排干]]洗衣房的污水。车夫认出送契人常去那间[[laundry|洗衣房]]换衣，不必在船口搜人。罗清陪着一位[[patient|病人]]等待，没有逼车夫再用疼痛证明勇气。","他们的[[argument|论证]]仍少旧契本身。商行[[agent|代理人]]以[[casual|漫不经心的]]口吻说洗衣房只收衣服，守门狗却叫得[[fierce|凶猛]]。封货胶的[[manufacturer|制造商]]借外埠先生作翻译，确认近日一次送货就在这里。一个[[sailor|水手]]熄了[[cigarette|香烟]]，说红匣曾从衣篮取出。车夫因恐惧承受的[[mental|心理]]压力很重，沈砚不要他再当诱饵。追回工钱的[[award|裁定]]由税署另开，不能等这趟追契成功才兑现。","许庭请来的市议[[politician|政客]]把两人堵在洗衣房前，话说得[[intense|激烈]]，像已经办好了包房[[reservation|预订]]。他用花木作[[screen|遮挡]]，不许工人看见院里的[[ditch|沟]]。罗清注意到沟中有细锯的[[blade|锯片]]，它曾使车夫的腿险些[[cripple|残废]]。许庭的[[rival|对手]]卖车商愿派[[mechanic|技工]]作对照，沈砚答应，但说明敌对关系也会记上。技工凭[[patience|耐心]]测出锯齿宽度，发现与坏轴相同，与普通劈木刀不同。","院中有人要[[install|安装]]新门锁，洗衣妇突然阻止，说收过契纸是她的[[admission|承认]]，偷改的不是她。送契人让她把大纸[[divide|分开]]，仅洗上面的布套；她留下一条布[[strip|条带]]，上有褪下来的旧红印。罗清给伤者安排既有的[[medication|药物照护]]后，陪她面对问话。沈砚不再与官话[[wrestle|苦斗]]，请先生看契句的[[grammar|语法]]：原句是商行代收桥费，换成商行拥有水权，主语被悄悄改过。洗衣妇拿出洗钱记录，与送货单的时辰吻合。","老人[[volunteer|自愿]]守住洗衣房，先生并未自称正义[[champion|捍卫者]]，先把保存布条的[[expense|费用]]记入联盟公账。一处被补过的[[stroke|笔画]]露出原文还款二字，而账房的新副本没有。沈砚请洗衣妇保留布套，不强夺她的东西，她才告诉他旧纸被带往船闸。他们离开时米车已经启程，车夫拿到了半月欠薪。剩下半月还要追，但孩子不再守着空碗。他把新领的铜钱一枚枚穿进绳中，留出买鞋的钱，把余下的亲手交给孩子，终于敢说今晚有饭。罗清向河上望去，船闸旁升起烟，那里的契纸可能已经换了第二只匣子。"],"en":["Shen went to [[quote|quote]] the ordinary rice price, but the driver watched a [[bubble|bubble]] in the washbasin. Having hauled for a [[plantation|plantation]], he knew heated packing glue loosened; it was not necessarily [[poison|poison]]. Luo raised an [[objection|objection]]: use did not replace testing. From another [[perspective|perspective]], they traced the glue. The driver began to [[hesitate|hesitate]], then showed his scarred [[wrist|wrist]]. The [[merchant|merchant]] who delivered the deed had made him [[mount|mount]] a boat and heated its seal with a [[cigar|cigar]], burning his hand.","Packaging [[ash|ash]] preserved beneath medicine bottles gave the [[dispute|dispute]] material evidence. The driver’s wage [[appeal|appeal]] made a servant nearly [[explode|explode]]. Xu called his partner’s tax relief a benevolent [[myth|myth]] and accused them of ruining it. Shen asked whose [[property|property]] had received relief. Instead, the clerk ordered men to [[drain|drain]] the washhouse. The driver recognized the [[laundry|laundry]] where the messenger changed clothes. Luo waited with her [[patient|patient]] rather than making pain another proof of courage.","Their [[argument|argument]] still lacked the deed. A trading [[agent|agent]] [[casual|casual]]ly called it only a washhouse, though its dog was [[fierce|fierce]]. Through the tutor, the glue [[manufacturer|manufacturer]] confirmed a delivery there. A [[sailor|sailor]] put out his [[cigarette|cigarette]] and described a red box lifted from a laundry basket. The driver’s [[mental|mental]] strain meant Shen would not use him as bait. A separate tax-office [[award|award]] addressed wages without making them depend on finding the deed.","A municipal [[politician|politician]] hired by Xu blocked them with [[intense|intense]] objections, as though the yard were a room under [[reservation|reservation]]. Trees formed a [[screen|screen]] hiding a [[ditch|ditch]]. Luo noticed a saw [[blade|blade]] that might have helped [[cripple|cripple]] the driver. Xu’s wagon-selling [[rival|rival]] sent a [[mechanic|mechanic]] for comparison. Shen recorded that rivalry too. With [[patience|patience]], the mechanic measured teeth matching the damaged axle rather than an ordinary chopping knife.","As men came to [[install|install]] a lock, the washerwoman stopped them. Her [[admission|admission]] was receiving the deed, not altering it. The messenger had asked her to [[divide|divide]] a wrapping and wash its cloth. She retained a [[strip|strip]] bearing transferred old red ink. After arranging existing [[medication|medication]], Luo supported her testimony. Rather than [[wrestle|wrestle]] with official language, Shen asked the tutor about the deed’s [[grammar|grammar]]: collecting bridge fees had become owning water rights through a changed subject. Washing payments matched the delivery time.","The elder would [[volunteer|volunteer]] to guard the building. The tutor did not claim to be a [[champion|champion]]; he recorded preservation [[expense|expense]] publicly. A retouched [[stroke|stroke]] revealed “repaid,” absent from the new copy. Shen asked the washerwoman to retain her property. She then disclosed that the old paper had gone to the boat lock. The rice wagon left; the driver received half his unpaid wages and his child finally ate. The rest remained owed. He threaded his coins onto string, reserved shoe money and gave the child the rest, able at last to promise supper. Smoke rose by the lock, where the deed might now be inside another box."]});
